{"pageProps":{"note":{"id":"vcpktgonlh3im7li1u6xtj0","title":"Server Parts Retailers","desc":"","updated":1746872620522,"created":1718109859748,"custom":{},"fname":"tech.server-parts-retailers","type":"note","vault":{"name":"main","fsPath":"main","useFMTitle":false},"contentHash":"b4ff4556713390a2c39557193c939e34","links":[],"anchors":{"retailers-for-server-parts":{"type":"header","text":"Retailers for server parts","value":"retailers-for-server-parts","line":8,"column":0,"depth":1},"online-retailers":{"type":"header","text":"Online Retailers","value":"online-retailers","line":12,"column":0,"depth":2},"memory":{"type":"header","text":"Memory","value":"memory","line":29,"column":0,"depth":2},"used-servers":{"type":"header","text":"Used Servers","value":"used-servers","line":35,"column":0,"depth":2},"boutique-manufacturers":{"type":"header","text":"Boutique Manufacturers","value":"boutique-manufacturers","line":39,"column":0,"depth":2}},"children":[],"parent":"fb9e4130-eaf8-425d-9039-5bc2ee876f18","data":{}},"body":"<h1 id=\"retailers-for-server-parts\">Retailers for server parts<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#retailers-for-server-parts\"></a></h1>\n<p>It can be hard to find specific server parts on mainstream retailers like Amazon or Newegg.</p>\n<h2 id=\"online-retailers\">Online Retailers<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#online-retailers\"></a></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://en.ctt.de\">CTT</a>: requires creating a free account to view prices, does ship internationally</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.wiredzone.com\">wiredzone</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.cdw.com/\">CDW</a>: ships internationally</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.networkhardwares.com/\">NetworkHardwares</a>: ships internationally</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.provantage.com\">provantage</a>: doesn't ship outside the US, forwarder needed</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.serversupply.com/\">ServerSupply</a>: US$500 minimum order and B2B for international orders, not sure if freight forwarders are supported</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://smicro.eu\">smicro</a>: unsure about shipping</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.pcnation.com/\">PCNation</a>: delivers to US addresses only, freight forwarding required</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.reichelt.com/sg/en\">reichelt</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.lambda-tek.com/shop/\">Lambda Tek</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://mitxpc.com/\">mitxpc</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.shopblt.com/\">BLT</a>: should ship worldwide, someone got an EPYC 9115. Only accepts bank transfers from Singapore</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.myelectronics.nl/us/\">MyElectronics 19 inch rack mounts for Raspberry Pi, NUC, Apple, Mini-ITX, HP and other mini PCs</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.etb-tech.com\">ETB Technologies</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"memory\">Memory<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#memory\"></a></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://memory.net\">memory.net</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://nemixram.com/\">NEMIX RAM</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.v-color.com.tw/\">V-color</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"used-servers\">Used Servers<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#used-servers\"></a></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.theserverstore.com\">The Server Store</a>: ships from the US, they mention international shipping is available but I'm unsure about shipping rates</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"boutique-manufacturers\">Boutique Manufacturers<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#boutique-manufacturers\"></a></h2>\n<p>Ships fully-built systems.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Falcon Northwest</li>\n<li>Puget Systems</li>\n<li>Maingear</li>\n<li>Digital Storm</li>\n<li>Velocity Micro</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.thomas-krenn.com/en/index.html\">Thomas-Krenn</a></li>\n</ul>","noteIndex":{"id":"root","title":"root","desc":"","updated":1622102326440,"created":1595961348801,"custom":{"stub":false